NAME
    useradd - add a new account

SYNOPSIS
    useradd <name>

DESCRIPTION
    Adds <name> to the process-wide account directory shared by every tmux
    session (like a real /etc/passwd) - root only. In-memory only, like
    every other piece of DianaSh state; accounts don't survive a process
    restart yet. See 'su' to switch to the new account.

EXAMPLES
    useradd kid
